  m_text: "Credits\r\n\r\nMusic:  \r\n<link=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWmGtAEln98&list=RDPWmGtAEln98&start_radio=1\"><u>Gerbarij
    - Volshebnyj mir</u></link>\r\n<link=\"https://mamaleek.bandcamp.com/track/my-body-rock-long-fever\"><u>Mamaleek
    - My Body Rock Long Fever</u></link>\r\n\r\nAssets:\r\nBuildings and plants on
    a whale are heavily modified models from Sketchfab 3D and Fab Epic store, that
    are not intended for commercial use, and are here purely for studying purposes.\r\n\r\nDesign:\r\nWhale
    inspired by the design of Ksenia Dvoretskaya and Anya Novina from exhibition
    \"Once Upon a Time: The Kingdom of the Russian Fairytale\"."
